    { exists 0; vm_compute; reflexivity. }
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { exists 1; vm_compute; reflexivity. }
    exfalso; lia.
  - exact fm12_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RB1LA_1LC0LC.
  - repeat constructor.
  - vm_compute; lia.
  - lia.
  - exact boot_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RB1LA_1LC0LC.
